sequenceDiagram
  participant Agent as Agent/Curator
  participant Store as proposalStore
  participant User as Reviewer
  participant Apply as apply service
  participant Verify as validator
  participant Audit as audit log

  Agent->>Store: create pending proposal
  User->>Store: accept/reject
  User->>Apply: apply accepted proposal
  Apply->>Verify: run validation
  Verify-->>Apply: result
  Apply->>Audit: append immutable audit event